#21601
Entrance to the Garden of Xinge~
    You stand before the legendary Garden of Xinge.  This was once the
great garden of Queen Vlania and King T'Pal, but with the falling of the
Kingdom of Xinge, the garden has fallen as well.  Now it is little more
than a run-down collection of weeds and wildflowers.  Still, you get a
feeling of death and dismay here, as if something still dwells within;
something not of this world...
~
