#21602
Wandering along the South Wall~
    You are walking though the Garden of Xinge.  An eerie silence seems to
press down upon you.  You hear no birds or insects, only the low moan of a
cold wind blowing through your clothing.  The ground is cracked and
dust-covered, and wildflowers grow unkempt throughout the area.
    To your south, a huge, vine-covered wall stands defying the ravages of
time.
~
